[scene format=1]

; The aurora backdrop (src/worlds.c builds the sky, the curtains, the range, the pines and the snow's glow): a snow
; field under a polar night, curtains of aurora rippling slowly across the sky in green going to violet at their
; tops, their light lying faintly on the snow, dark pines either side of the valley, a far range under snow.

